          "2012 | the Thursday potluck moves to its fourth church | BACK | #12b795",
          "2017 | lake floods the boardwalk; sandbags on Bernard | BACK | #12b795",
          "2020 | every venue dark; the drag calendar goes to zero | PENDING | #fe9a0d",
          "2021 | heat dome; the lake gives back a rowboat | BACK | #12b795",
